<title>FRANCE: Eurotunnel August traffic climbs.</title>
<headline>Eurotunnel August traffic climbs.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Channel Tunnel operator Eurotunnel SA/Plc said on Monday that its Le Shuttle tourist service carried 304,032 vehicles in August compared to 145,861 in August 1995.</p>
<p>Eurotunnel said its Le Shuttle freight service carried 46,045 trucks compared to 36,517 in the year-earlier period.</p>
<p>The company said its Eurostar passenger service carried 566,247 people in August compared with 279,449 in August 1995.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5452</p>
